 <section>
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
        
        <!-- Profile Image Start -->
        <div class="profile-img-container">
            <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Dr. Logenthiran Machap" class="profile-img">
        </div>
        <!-- Profile Image End -->

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
                    <p class="lead text-center">My objective is to advance impactful research in bioinformatics, machine learning, and data science while inspiring and mentoring students through innovative teaching and supervision.</p>
                    
                    <h4 class="mt-5">Education</h4>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-date">2013 - 2020</div>
                        <h5>PhD in Computer Science</h5>
                        <p>University of Technology Malaysia (UTM)<br>
                        <em>Thesis: Identifying Cancer Gene Subtypes from Gene Expression by Co-Clustering Algorithm and Support Vector Machine</em></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-date">2011 - 2013</div>
                        <h5>Master of Computer Science (Database Technology)</h5>
                        <p>University of Technical Malaysia Melaka (UTeM)<br>
                        <em>Project: Functional Dependency for Missing Values Problem in Microbial Genomics</em></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-date">2007 - 2010</div>
                        <h5>BSc. Bioinformatics (Hons)</h5>
                        <p>National University of Malaysia (UKM)<br>
                        <em>Project: Analysis of Triple Base RNA Interaction in the Structures of Riboswitches</em></p>
                    </div>

                    <h4 class="mt-5">Technical Skills</h4>
                    <div class="card p-3">
                        <strong>Programming:</strong><br>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Python</span><span class="skill-tag">R</span><span class="skill-tag">C++</span><span class="skill-tag">C#</span><span class="skill-tag">SQL/MySQL</span><span class="skill-tag">SAS</span><span class="skill-tag">HTML</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card p-3">
                        <strong>Bioinformatics Tools:</strong><br>
                        <span class="skill-tag">BLAST</span><span class="skill-tag">TCOFFEE</span><span class="skill-tag">ClustalW</span><span class="skill-tag">Mfold</span><span class="skill-tag">InterProScan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card p-3">
                        <strong>Platforms & Apps:</strong><br>
                        <span class="skill-tag">MATLAB</span><span class="skill-tag">WEKA</span><span class="skill-tag">RapidMiner</span><span class="skill-tag">Hadoop</span><span class="skill-tag">AWS</span>
                    </div>

                    <h4 class="mt-5">Languages</h4>
